    "id": "hannah",
    "name": "Hannah",
    "sex": "female",
    "era": "Judges",
    "summary": "One of Elkanah's two wives from Ramathaim-zophim. She has no children, and Peninnah taunts her. At Shiloh, Eli first mistakes her intense prayer for drunkenness. She promises to give a son to the Lord. She bears Samuel and brings him to Shiloh after he stops nursing, leaving him there to serve. First Samuel 2 opens with her prayer of praise. The account later gives her three more sons and two daughters.",
